  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3118.03 Physical Examination. All applicants for CDL driver education certificates shall meet and maintain the physical requirements for commercial drivers set forth in 49 CFR 391.43.\n\nSource. #13171, eff 2-22-21",
